<!doctype html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:12mm}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#eee;margin:0;padding:30px;color:#171717}.actions{text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px}.actions button{padding:11px 18px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#ff7900;color:#fff;font-weight:800}.card{width:86mm;height:54mm;margin:auto;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff7900,#ff9d35);border-radius:5mm;padding:5mm;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 29mm;gap:3mm;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #aaa;overflow:hidden}.brand{font-size:17px;font-weight:900;color:#fff}.plus{font-size:10px;color:#fff7ed;font-weight:800}.name{font-size:17px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin-top:8px}.number{font-size:9px;color:#fff;margin-top:3px}.points{font-size:19px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin-top:7px}.expiry{font-size:8px;color:#fff;margin-top:5px}.qr{background:#fff;border-radius:3mm;padding:2mm;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.qr img{width:100%;height:auto}.note{text-align:center;margin:18px auto;max-width:650px;font-size:12px;color:#555}@media print{body{background:#fff;padding:0}.actions,.note{display:none}.card{box-shadow:none;margin:0}}</style></head><body><div class="actions"><button onclick="window.print()">🖨 Imprimer la carte</button></div><div class="card"><div><div class="brand">TiopTiop</div><div class="plus">CARTE AVANTAGE TIOP+</div><div class="name"><%= card.display_name || [card.first_name,card.last_name].filter(Boolean).join(' ') %></div><div class="number"><%= card.card_number %> • <%= card.card_type %></div><div class="points">⭐ <%= card.points_balance %> POINTS</div><div class="expiry">Valable jusqu'au : <%= card.expires_at ? new Date(card.expires_at).toLocaleDateString('fr-FR') : 'Sans expiration' %></div></div><div class="qr"><img src="<%= qrDataUrl %>" alt="QR sécurisé Tiop+"></div></div><p class="note">Le nombre de points imprimé correspond au solde au moment de l'impression. Le QR sécurisé permettra au POS de vérifier le solde réel, le statut et l'expiration de la carte.</p></body></html>
